<html>
<title>XML Configurations</title>
<body>

<h1>XML Configurations</h1>

<p>
This section lists and explains some of the included XML configuration files.
</p>


<h2>General</h2>

<p><strong>bare.xml</strong></p>
<p>
Any XML file with <code>bare</code> in the filename includes a basic configuration for that specific computer.
</p>


<h2>CDP18S020 Evaluation Kit</h2>

<p><strong>tiny basic hex modem.xml</strong></p>
<p>
Tiny BASIC loaded into RAM via the hex modem.
</p>

<p><strong>tiny basic ram.xml</strong></p>
<p>
Tiny BASIC directly loaded into RAM.
</p>


<h2>COMIX-35 and COMX-35</h2>

<p><strong>diagnostic-&lt;video-type&gt;.xml</strong></p>
<p>
COMX Diagnostic Board for video type <code>pal</code> or <code>ntsc</code>.
</p>

<p><strong>fdc-print-32k-80col.xml</strong></p>
<p>
COMX configured with FDC, standard printer, 32K RAM and 80-column card.
</p>

<p><strong>fdc-print-32k-eprom.xml</strong></p>
<p>
COMX configured with FDC, standard printer, 32K RAM and F&amp;M EPROM board.
</p>

<p><strong>fdc-thermal-32k-joy.xml</strong></p>
<p>
COMX configured with FDC, thermal printer, 32K RAM and joy card.
</p>

<p><strong>&lt;video-type&gt;_high_speed_direct_connect.xml</strong></p>
<p>
COMX configured with High Speed Direct Connect board for video type <code>pal</code> or <code>ntsc</code>.
</p>

<p><strong>superboard-80col.xml</strong></p>
<p>
COMX configured with SuperBoard and 80-column card.
</p>

<p><strong>superboard.xml</strong></p>
<p>
COMX configured with SuperBoard.
</p>


