<p><strong>cdp18s693-mcds.xml</strong></p>
<p>
RCA low-cost Microboard Computer Development System (MCDS) CDP18S693.
</p>
<p>
Includes CDP18S601 CPU board and CDP18S652 Memory & tape board.
</p>
<p>
CDP18S601 includes 4 KB RAM and no ROM.
</p>
<p>
CDP18S652 includes UT62 at 8000-87FF (hexadecimal), BASIC 3 at B000-DFFF (hexadecimal) and 1 KB RAM at 8C00 (hexadecimal).
</p>

<p><strong>cdp18s694-mcds.xml</strong></p>
<p>
RCA higher-performance Microboard Computer Development System (MCDS) CDP18S694.
</p>
<p>
Includes CDP18S601 CPU board and CDP18S652 Memory & tape board.
</p>
<p>
CDP18S652 includes UT62 at 8000-87FF (hexadecimal), Assembler/Editor at 9000-AFFF (hexadecimal), BASIC 3 at B000-DFFF (hexadecimal) and 1 KB RAM at 8C00 (hexadecimal).
</p>
<p>
This configuration matches the MCDS emulator.
</p>

<p><strong>cdp18s695-mcds.xml</strong></p>
<p>
RCA higher-performance color Microboard Computer Development System (MCDS) CDP18S695.
</p>
<p>
Includes CDP18S601 CPU board, CDP18S652 Memory & tape board and CDP18S661B NTSC video board.
</p>
<p>
CDP18S652 includes UT63 at 8000-87FF (hexadecimal), Assembler/Editor at 9000-AFFF (hexadecimal), BASIC 3 at B000-DFFF (hexadecimal) and 1 KB RAM at 8C00 (hexadecimal).
</p>

<p><strong>comx-demo-ntsc.xml</strong></p>
<p>
Demo configuration using a COMX-like setup including a CDP18S661B NTSC video board.
</p>
<p>
This is not a complete COMX configuration but demonstrates the NTSC video board.
</p>

<p><strong>comx-demo-pal.xml</strong></p>
<p>
Demo configuration using a COMX-like setup including a CDP18S661V3 PAL video board.
</p>
<p>
This is not a complete COMX configuration but demonstrates the PAL video board.
</p>

